# Built binaries (`go build` names it after the module, edmin; `gio` is the
# folder's name, as given by `go build -o gio` or an IDE)
/edmin
/gio

# Test binaries and coverage profiles (go test -c, -coverprofile)
*.test
*.out

# EdMin's own per-project state when editing this repo with EdMin: build
# commands, theme and terminal names
/.edmin/
